# Implementation workflow

- Before a non-trivial task, inspect the relevant docs/rules and current repository state.
- Follow `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` phase order unless the user explicitly changes scope.
- Do not silently implement future phases.
- Prefer small coherent commits/changes that leave the repository runnable.
- After each phase run lint, typecheck, tests and build; fix errors introduced by the work.
- Update implementation-plan checkboxes/status only for work actually completed.
- Do not delete existing user code/files merely because a generated scaffold differs; migrate intentionally.
- Summarize changed files, commands run, test results, remaining risks and the exact next phase.
